й цели.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=62904,["name"]="Death Coil",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathCoil",["conditionRu"]="Расход силы рун; сохраняйте ресурс для защиты.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=49206,["name"]="Summon Gargoyle",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Bat",["conditionRu"]="Окно урона вместе с контролем напарника.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["DRUID:Balance"]={["classToken"]="DRUID",["sourceSpec"]="Balance",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель дальнего боя, чередующий затмения.","Мощное массовое заклинание звёздопада и полезные усиления группы.","Перемещения во время затмения снижают урон; масштабирование зависит от экипировки."},["enUS"]={"Druids are the only class in the game capable of fulling all four roles: tank, healer, ranged DPS, and melee DPS.","Very high burst area damage with Starfall and Hurricane. Simple rotation allows for more attention to be paid to the encounters themselves. Excellent support with Moonkin Form, Improved Moonkin Form, Improved Mark of the Wild, Improved Faerie Fire, and many","Poor scaling with gear when compared to the top caster specializations. While Balance brings a ton of utility, none of it is unique and can be brought by other classes. Mobility is very weak as damage requires near-constant casting and"}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте нужные группе ослабления. Используйте гнев до лунного затмения и звёздный огонь во время него; при солнечном затмении переключайтесь на гнев. Обновление периодического урона зависит от бонусов комплекта.",["enUS"]="A special optimization with the Tier 10 2-piece bonus is to stand in melee range with a quick weapon and high Haste to get in a melee swing every time you do an instant cast such as Insect Swarm. This will lead to a higher rate of Omen of Clarity procs, which in turn convert into higher damage from the Tier 10 bonus. In single-target you will look towards the following priority: Keep Faerie Fire on the target if raiding, for the Improved Faerie Fire debuff. You can skip it if another Druid is keeping it up and your raid has the 3% Spell Hit debuff already; Use Force of Nature within melee range of the boss. You can delay it to line up with Bloodlust if it won't cost you an extra use during the fight; Use Starfall in"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Best Wrath Balance PvE Talent Build (58/0/13)",["talentsString"]="5012203115331303213305311231--205003012",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=762,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16818,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Starlight Wrath",["nameRu"]="Starlight Wrath"},{["talentID"]=783,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=16845,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Moonglow",["nameRu"]="Moonglow"},{["talentID"]=1822,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=35364,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Nature's Majesty",["nameRu"]="Nature's Majesty"},{["talentID"]=763,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16822,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Moonfire",["nameRu"]="Improved Moonfire"},{["talentID"]=789,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=61346,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Nature's Grace",["nameRu"]="Nature's Grace"},{["talentID"]=2240,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=57865,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Nature's Splendor",["nameRu"]="Nature's Splendor"},{["talentID"]=764,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=16819,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Nature's Reach",["nameRu"]="Nature's Reach"},{["talentID"]=792,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16913,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Vengeance",["nameRu"]="Vengeance"},{["talentID"]=784,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=16924,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3