,["condition"]="Use and refresh (after it expires) Savage Roar;"},{["spellID"]=16857,["name"]="Faerie Fire (Feral)",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_FaerieFire",["condition"]="Use Faerie Fire (Feral) to proc Omen of Clarity unless you are already under its effect;"},{["spellID"]=48572,["name"]="Shred",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_VampiricAura",["condition"]="Use any Omen of Clarity procs on Shred;"},{["spellID"]=49800,["name"]="Rip",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_GhoulFrenzy",["condition"]="Use and refresh (after it expires) Rip at 5 Combo Points;"},{["spellID"]=48574,["name"]="Rake",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Disembowel",["condition"]="Use and refresh (after it expires) Rake;"},{["spellID"]=48566,["name"]="Mangle (Cat)",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Mangle2",["condition"]="Keep Mangle (Cat)'s debuff on your target unless you have another Feral DPS Druid or an Arms Warrior with Trauma in the raid;"},{["spellID"]=48572,["name"]="Shred",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_VampiricAura",["condition"]="Use Shred to build Combo Points if doing so will not prevent you in the near future from having enough Energy to instantly refresh your damage-over-time effects or Mangle (Cat)'s debuff."}}}},["pvp"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Гибридный боец с чередованием урона, лечения и контроля.","Удары под оглушением и мгновенный контроль создают повторяемые окна.","Нужно одновременно следить за формами, ресурсами и состоянием союзников."},["enUS"]={"Feral Druids have strong burst damage, great mobility, stealth, and also have instant healing or undispellable crowd-control with Predatory Strikes, which turns your next spell after a finisher into an instant cast. This has great synergy with Cyclone, which can easily turn the tide of","",""}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Готовьте серию приёмов под калечение, дополняя её перекрёстным контролем союзника. Заставляйте противника расходовать защиту и возвращайтесь к следующему окну, не забывая лечение и смену формы.",["enUS"]="Rather than a fixed rotation, Druid gameplay is about treading a fine balance between damage, healing, and crowd controlling, with periodic Maim burst periods helped out by cross crowd control from the instant Cyclone you gain from the Maim cast. These periods are meant to force cooldowns, PvP trinkets, and eventually land a kill once all enemy outs have been exhausted, leading to a steady gameplay loop where you are always looking towards your next Maim. If enemies turn the pressure on you, you can kite away from them with Travel Form and Nature's Grasp, endure the pressure with Dire Bear Form and Frenzied Regeneration, or use one of your defensive cooldowns, Barkskin and Survival Instincts."},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Feral Druid PvP Talent Build (0/55/16)",["talentsString"]="-503202132320212053113003310511-005503012",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=796,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16938,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Ferocity",["nameRu"]="Ferocity"},{["talentID"]=799,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=16949,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Feral Instinct",["nameRu"]="Feral Instinct"},{["talentID"]=805,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16999,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Savage Fury",["nameRu"]="Savage Fury"},{["talentID"]=807,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=24866,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Feral Swiftness",["nameRu"]="Feral Swiftness"},{["talentID"]=1162,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=61336,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Survival Instincts",["nameRu"]="Survival Instincts"},{["talentID"]=798,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=16944,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Sharpened Claws",["nameRu"]="Sharpened Claws"},{["talentID"]=802,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16968,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Shredding Attacks",["nameRu"]="Shredding Attacks"},{["talentID"]=803,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=16975,["tree"]=2,["minL