h of Dash"},{["itemID"]=43332,["spellID"]=57862,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorDruid",["classToken"]="DRUID",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Thorns",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Thorns"}},["glyphIssues"]={},["trees"]={"Balance","Feral Combat","Restoration"},["source"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/feral-druid-pvp-guide",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/druid-talent-calculator#tc-sssssvvxxzzzCCBBBAAFJJIIIIIKRQQQTTyYYYYZZZZZ~...[YGGEEPPPLJMMMuuuTTTVU[|0q1u3i4m5j2L"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/feral-druid-pvp-guide",["sha256"]="ecdbae52bd7dc68e5c7a42ca9092ff7d8c6c0e9c43710df289ae974261bbcede",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="pvp",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=49802,["name"]="Maim",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Mangle.tga",["conditionRu"]="Оглушение под серию приёмов; нужны приёмы.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=33786,["name"]="Cyclone",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthBind",["conditionRu"]="Перекрёстный контроль или защита союзника.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=22812,["name"]="Barkskin",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StoneClawTotem",["conditionRu"]="Под ответное давление, а не как часть атаки.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["DRUID:Feral tank"]={["classToken"]="DRUID",["sourceSpec"]="Feral tank",["role"]="tank",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Танк в облике медведя с большим запасом здоровья.","Выживаемость и удобное совмещение с кошкой вне активного танкования.","Ограниченный массовый набор угрозы; эффективный переход в кошку сложнее."},["enUS"]={"Druids are the only class in the game capable of fulling all four roles: tank, healer, ranged DPS, and melee DPS.","High single-target damage for a tank and great survivability capabilities due to very large health pool. Great Physical group support with Leader of the Pack and the unique Improved Leader of the Pack. Best tank / DPS hybrid class, as","Utility brought tends to either be weak or able to be brought by more meta classes. Area damage is limited to Swipe (Bear) and Mangle with Berserk active. While pure Dire Bear Form form gameplay is very simple, obtaining maximum"}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Увечье и волшебный огонь используйте по готовности; поддерживайте пять стаков растерзать. Трёпка расходует избыток ярости, размах — оставшиеся ресурсы и несколько целей. Исступление снижает защиту.",["enUS"]="Enrage is an important ability for burst Rage and increases your damage by 15% with King of the Jungle, but also lowers your defenses significantly, making it ideal to use just before pulling for initial burst threat on the boss. Avoid using it during an encounter, as you are unlikely to need the threat burst, but will still suffer the full defensive downside. Use Berserk when available; Use Mangle (Bear) when available; Use Faerie Fire (Feral) when available; Use (and refresh before it expires) Lacerate until the enemy has 5 stacks ticking; Use Maul; Use Swipe (Bear) if you still have excess Rage after spamming Maul. Use Berserk and spam Mangle (Bear) while it is active; Use Swipe (Bear); Use Maul with extra Rage."},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Wrath Feral Main-Tank PvE Talent Build (0/60/11)",["talentsString"]="-503232132322010353120300313511-20350001",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=796,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16938,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Ferocity",["nameRu"]="Ferocity"},{["talentID"]=799,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=16949,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Feral Instinct",["nameRu"]="Feral Instinct"},{["talentID"]=805,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16999,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="S