4e2b586f2cfa9e27d410e300dd04bb1c38e2962f45d84fe01f7eea0a40b540",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="pvp",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=9840,["name"]="Rejuvenation",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Rejuvenation",["conditionRu"]="Заранее поддерживайте периодическое лечение.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=48451,["name"]="Lifebloom",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Herb_Felblossom",["conditionRu"]="Поддержка выбранной цели; следите за маной.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=50464,["name"]="Nourish",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Nourish",["conditionRu"]="Безопасное чтение срочного лечения.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=33786,["name"]="Cyclone",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthBind",["conditionRu"]="Контроль только если союзник переживёт паузу в лечении.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["HUNTER:Beast mastery"]={["classToken"]="HUNTER",["sourceSpec"]="Beast mastery",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Боец дальнего боя, значительная часть урона которого приходится на питомца.","Сильный взрывной урон, массовые атаки, удобная самостоятельная игра.","Необходимо управлять питомцем; длительный урон по одной цели уступает другим вариантам."},["enUS"]={"Hunters are master marksmen and, with the help of a fierce animal companion, can deal damage from range without ever letting their target get close. With special tracking abilities, traps, and a wide range of utility spells, Hunters are a great choice for anyone looking","Excellent burst damage. Top-tier AoE, both for burst and sustained. Brings a raid buff with Ferocious Inspiration. Strong utility, including Misdirection and Feign Death. One of the easiest classes to gear early on in Wrath. Incredible leveling speed and solo-play","Pet-based class, which means you will need to micro-manage your pet sometimes. Lackluster sustained single-target damage. Least valuable Hunter specialization in raids. Lack of defensive and self-healing cooldowns."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте метку и укус змеи; используйте команду взять и добивающий выстрел по условиям. Ловушка, залп и чародейский выстрел выше верного выстрела-заполнителя. Следите за маной и питомцем.",["enUS"]="Always start by ensuring all the required buffs are active, you have Aspect of the Dragonhawk up, and Hunter's Mark is on the target. Kill Command Kill Shot Explosive Trap Maintain Serpent Sting Multi-Shot Arcane Shot Steady Shot as your filler. If you get low on Mana, you can always drop Multi-Shot from your rotation. Kill Command should always be used on cooldown, and since it is off the GCD, you can actually macro it into all of your other abilities to ensure it gets used properly. Hunter AoE revolves entirely around two buttons: Explosive Trap and Volley. Volley is significantly more powerful in Wrath than in TBC, and actually makes Hunter AoE some of the strongest in the game. Properly setting up an Explosive Trap into Volley spam on an AoE pack will do absolutely incredible damage that very"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Builds for Beast Mastery Hunter (52/14/5)",["talentsString"]="51200201505112233110531251-0053051-5",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1382,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=19556,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Improved Aspect of the Hawk",["nameRu"]="Improved Aspect of the Hawk"},{["talentID"]=1389,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=19583,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Endurance Training",["nameRu"]="Endurance Training"},{["talentID"]=1624,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=35030,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Focused Fire",["n