Icons\\inv_glyph_minorhunter",["classToken"]="HUNTER",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Mend Pet",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Mend Pet"},{["itemID"]=43356,["spellID"]=57902,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_glyph_minorhunter",["classToken"]="HUNTER",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Scare Beast",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Scare Beast"}},["glyphIssues"]={},["trees"]={"Beast Mastery","Marksmanship","Survival"},["source"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/beast-mastery-hunter-pvp-guide",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/hunter-talent-calculator#tc-111114445522788888aaaaacddeefffggghkkkkknnnlllmooooopsssssvvvvvywtttSSS|0m1x2d3g4c5h"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/beast-mastery-hunter-pvp-guide",["sha256"]="1213748f0ccb8c077bc936c8feaf0f02870b0cfaca11bf32887a3c0e7eee8b9a",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="pvp",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=19577,["name"]="Intimidation",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Devour",["conditionRu"]="Подготовьте окно контроля питомцем.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=19574,["name"]="Bestial Wrath",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite",["conditionRu"]="Цель доступна питомцу; согласуйте с напарником.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=19434,["name"]="Aimed Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Spear_07",["conditionRu"]="Поддерживайте снижение лечения.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=61006,["name"]="Kill Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Assassinate2",["conditionRu"]="Добивание при выполнении условия здоровья.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["HUNTER:Marksmanship"]={["classToken"]="HUNTER",["sourceSpec"]="Marksmanship",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Стрелок с физическими выстрелами и хорошим масштабированием.","Урон по одной и нескольким целям, перенаправление угрозы.","Зависит от качества экипировки; мало самолечения и защиты."},["enUS"]={"Hunters are master marksmen and, with the help of a fierce animal companion, can deal damage from range without ever letting their target get close. With special tracking abilities, traps, and a wide range of utility spells, Hunters are a great choice for anyone looking","Excellent damage of all types, both on AoE and single target. Brings a raid buff with Trueshot Aura. Strong utility, including Misdirection and Feign Death. One of the easiest classes to gear early on in Wrath. Incredible leveling speed and","Pet-based class, which means you will need to micro-manage your pet sometimes. Needs some gear to scale with. Lack of defensive and self-healing cooldowns."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Добивающий выстрел — по доступности. Поддерживайте укус змеи, используйте выстрел химеры и прицельный выстрел; верный выстрел заполняет паузы. Команду питомцу и ловушку используйте, не теряя основные выстрелы.",["enUS"]="Always start by ensuring all the required buffs are active, you have Aspect of the Dragonhawk up, and Hunter's Mark is on the target. Kill Shot Kill Command Maintain Serpent Sting Explosive Trap Chimera Shot Aimed Shot Arcane Shot Silencing Shot Steady Shot as your filler. Chimera Shot will refresh Serpent Sting for you, so you should never need to manually reapply it. Arcane Shot will eventually be dropped from your rotation once you reach around ~430 ArP, as it is not Physical damage and does not scale well with your talents. Kill Command and Silencing Shot are both off the GCD. You can simply macro these into other spells to ensure you always use them. If Mana is an issue, drop Silencing Shot from your rotation. Hunter AoE revolves entirely around two buttons: Explosive Trap and Volley. Volley is"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Builds for Marksmanship Hunter (7/54/10)",["talentsString"]="502-005335101030013233135031251-5000032",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1382,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=19556,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Improved Aspect of the Hawk",["nameRu"]="Improved Aspect of the Hawk"},{["talentID"]=1624,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=35030,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Focused Fire",["nameRu"]="Focused Fire"},{["talentID"]=1344,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=19431,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Lethal Shots",["nameRu"]="Lethal Shots"},{["talentID"]=1806,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=34484,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Careful Aim",["nameRu"]="Careful Aim"},{["talentID"]=1343,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=19423,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Hunter's Mark",["nameRu"]="Improved Hunter's Mark"},{["talentID"]=1349,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=19490,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Mortal Shots",["nameRu"]="Mortal Shots"},{["talentID"]=1818,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=34950,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Go for the Throat",["nameRu"]="Go for the Throat"},{["talentID"]=1345,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=19434,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Aimed Shot",["nameRu"]="Aimed Shot"},{["talentID"]=1348,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=19466,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Stings",["nameRu"]="Improved Stings"},{["talentID"]=1353,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=23989,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=30,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Readiness",["nameRu"]="Readiness"},{["talentID"]=1347,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=24691,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=30,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Barrage",["nameRu"]="Barrage"},{["talentID"]=1804,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=34476,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=35,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Combat Experience",["nameRu"]="Combat Experience"},{["talentID"]=1362,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=19509,["tree"]=2,["