w.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/arcane-mage-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["sha256"]="bea2c10280c001d4f97672b8041f04f0b4bc4c93a405bba9757523751179abb6",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/arcane-mage-dps-pve-rotation-cooldowns-abilities",["sha256"]="c0827fd5bd301953433dda3610407f8ba827c6745435b767dc7fdb622855c659",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="priority",["heading"]="Single Target Damage",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=42897,["name"]="Arcane Blast",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Blast",["condition"]="Cast 4x Arcane Blast (AB)"},{["spellID"]=27075,["name"]="Arcane Missiles",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StarFall",["condition"]="If Missile Barrage (Mbar) proc, cast Arcane Missiles (AM). With no Mbar proc, cast AB"},{["spellID"]=27075,["name"]="Arcane Missiles",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StarFall",["condition"]="If Missile Barrage (Mbar) proc, cast Arcane Missiles (AM). With no Mbar proc, cast AB"},{["spellID"]=27075,["name"]="Arcane Missiles",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StarFall",["condition"]="Arcane Missiles (AM)"},{["spellID"]=27075,["name"]="Arcane Missiles",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StarFall",["condition"]="Start at step 1 whenever you cast Arcane Missiles."}}}},["pvp"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель, подготавливающий окно урона цепочкой контроля.","Сильное управляемое окно под наступательными усилениями.","Срыв контроля и небезопасное чтение лишают возможности завершить атаку."},["enUS"]={"Arcane Mages are a bursty specialization, which relies on high burst damage from procs and abilities to win matches. They have great burst damage, but these are tied to cooldowns, so wins usually have to be fast or a loss is inevitable, especially against teams","",""}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Сначала ограничьте ответ противника контролем, затем объединяйте наступательные кулдауны. Сохраняйте инструменты дистанции и защиты; не пытайтесь повторять рейдовую последовательность без учёта ситуации.",["enUS"]="Rather than a fixed rotation, Mage gameplay is about setting up crowd control chains, followed by bursting down a target with all of your cooldowns at once. Use your spells accordingly to keep enemies under control, and try to find the best timing to burst them down: Keep yourself alive with Frost Nova, Mana Shield, Frost Ward, Fire Ward, Evocation, and Blink. Stay in control of the match with Polymorph, Counterspell, Slow, and Spellsteal. Burst someone down with Arcane Power, Icy Veins, and Presence of Mind, coupled with Arcane Blast, Missile Barraged Arcane Missiles and the instant-cast Arcane Barrage. If you fail to kill the enemy within the Arcane Power timing, it is likely that you will run out of Mana and / or Health before getting a second chance."},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Arcane PvP Mage Talent Build (53/7/11)",["talentsString"]="205324200122032103303102015321-23002-303020201",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=74,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12592,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Arcane Subtlety",["nameRu"]="Arcane Subtlety"},{["talentID"]=80,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16770,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Arcane Stability",["nameRu"]="Arcane Stability"},{["talentID"]=85,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=54659,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Arcane Fortitude",["nameRu"]="Arcane Fortitude"},{["talentID"]=1650,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=29444,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Magic Absorption",["nameRu"]="Magic Absorption"},{["talentID"]=75,["rank"]=4,["spellID"]=12576,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Arcane Concentration",["nameRu"]="Arcane Concentration"},{["talentID"]=82,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12606,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Magic Attunement",["nameRu"]="Magic Attunement"},{["talentID"]=2211,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=54646,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]