Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Blast",["conditionRu"]="Когда можно безопасно читать.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=44781,["name"]="Arcane Barrage",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_ArcaneBarrage",["conditionRu"]="Мгновенный урон и движение.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["MAGE:Fire"]={["classToken"]="MAGE",["sourceSpec"]="Fire",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель с критическими ударами, периодическим уроном и мгновенной огненной глыбой.","Сильный длительный и массовый урон, усиление в завершающей фазе.","Зависимость от проков; требования к меткости и угроза."},["enUS"]={"Mage has three balanced PvE talent trees. This guide will lead you through the World of Fire Mage. While Arcane Mages are considered the strongest short fight nuke spec and Frost Mages are considered to be leveling and PvP gods, Fire Mage excels at consistently","High overall damage. Benefits from execute phase in longer fights. Best AoE damage of all Mage specs. Frostfire spec needs as much hit rating as Arcane, making it a perfect dual-spec spec. Not as Mana-hungry as Arcane (Frostfire is very","Higher threat. Fire TTW needs more Hit rating than Arcane (FFB spec does not). In short fights worse Single Target DPS than Arcane. Requires you to focus on procs to be most efficient."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте живую бомбу. Ожог нужен, если группа не даёт соответствующее ослабление. Основное заклинание — огненный шар; используйте мгновенную огненную глыбу от разогрева и планируйте восстановление маны.",["enUS"]="Fire Mages are capable of doing huge amounts of single-target damage, especially in long fights during Molten Fury. Your main rotation will be to keep up Living Bomb (prioritize refreshing Living Bomb over using a Pyroblast Hot Streak proc). If no Destruction Warlock with Improved Shadow Bolt or no Frost Mage with Winter's Chill is around, you need to keep up the Improved Scorch debuff by casting Scorch every 30 seconds. Cast Fireballs and, when you score two crits in a row and Hot Streak activates, cast an instant Pyroblast. As of Phase 3, Mages will no longer need to deal with the 'Ignite Munching' problem, which was previously solved with addons and macros. Ignite munching basically meant that you lost Ignite damage from a Hot Streaked Pyroblast hitting at the same time as a Fireball, because one Ignite got"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Fire TTW Talents (18/53/0)",["talentsString"]="23000503110003-0055030012302331053120311351-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=74,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12592,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Arcane Subtlety",["nameRu"]="Arcane Subtlety"},{["talentID"]=76,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12840,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Arcane Focus",["nameRu"]="Arcane Focus"},{["talentID"]=75,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=12577,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Arcane Concentration",["nameRu"]="Arcane Concentration"},{["talentID"]=81,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12469,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Spell Impact",["nameRu"]="Spell Impact"},{["talentID"]=1845,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=44397,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Student of the Mind",["nameRu"]="Student of the Mind"},{["talentID"]=2211,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=54646,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Focus Magic",["nameRu"]="Focus Magic"},{["talentID"]=2222,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=55340,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Torment the Weak",["nameRu"]="Torment the Weak"},{["talentID"]=26,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=12341,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Improved Fireball",["nameRu"]="Improved Fireball"},{["talentID"]=34,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=12848,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Ignite",["nameRu"]="Ignite"