-dps-pve-rotation-cooldowns-abilities",["sha256"]="7df8046281a844680c79973b3a128cba1e1b5da583af837f1081849ab4af1f27",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="priority",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=55360,["name"]="Living Bomb",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_LivingBomb",["condition"]="Refresh after the bomb explodes.",["conditionRu"]="Обновляйте после взрыва бомбы."},{["spellID"]=42859,["name"]="Scorch",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SoulBurn",["condition"]="Only if the raid needs Improved Scorch.",["conditionRu"]="Только если группе нужен эффект улучшенного ожога."},{["spellID"]=42891,["name"]="Pyroblast",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball02",["condition"]="Instant cast with Hot Streak.",["conditionRu"]="Мгновенно при проке «Путь огня»."},{["spellID"]=42833,["name"]="Fireball",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FlameBolt",["condition"]="Filler between refreshes and procs.",["conditionRu"]="Заполнитель между обновлениями и проками.",["ffbIcon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_FrostFireBolt"}}}},["pvp"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель с давлением живой бомбой и мгновенными проками.","Проки разогрева и распределение бомб создают опасные окна.","Результат зависит от проков и возможности избежать ответного давления."},["enUS"]={"Fire Mages are an unconventional specialization, which relies on steady and high damage. They have less single-target burst damage than Arcane Mages, while the Fire Mage AoE is really strong. Their single-target damage is more sustained and not as tied towards long cooldowns, and their","",""}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Готовьте контроль, затем используйте окно наступательных способностей. Живая бомба на нескольких противниках помогает давить и раздвигать их позицию; следите, чтобы взрыв не сорвал нужный контроль.",["enUS"]="Rather than a fixed rotation, Mage gameplay is about setting up crowd control chains, followed by bursting down a target with all of your cooldowns at once, hoping for many Hot Streak procs. DoTting up multiple enemies with Living Bomb can be fatal for them and can even be used as a tactical way to keep them spread, which makes focusing one person a little easier. Use your spells accordingly to keep enemies under control, and try to find the best timing to burst them down: Keep yourself alive with Frost Nova, Mana Shield, Blast Wave, Dragon's Breath, and Blink. Stay in control of the match with Polymorph, Counterspell, and Spellsteal. Burst someone down with Combustion, Frostfire Bolt, and Hot Streak or Fiery Payback Pyroblasts. Use Scorch or Fire Blast to finish off and stun enemies (Impact) and use Pyroblast"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Pyro Fire PvP Mage Talent Build (19/52/0)",["talentsString"]="230320130122-2305202310120031253112301351-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=74,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12592,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Arcane Subtlety",["nameRu"]="Arcane Subtlety"},{["talentID"]=76,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12840,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Arcane Focus",["nameRu"]="Arcane Focus"},{["talentID"]=85,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=54659,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Arcane Fortitude",["nameRu"]="Arcane Fortitude"},{["talentID"]=1650,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=29444,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Magic Absorption",["nameRu"]="Magic Absorption"},{["talentID"]=82,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=11247,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Magic Attunement",["nameRu"]="Magic Attunement"},{["talentID"]=81,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12469,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Spell Impact",["nameRu"]="Spell Impact"},{["talentID"]=2211,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=54646,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Focus Magic",["nameRu"]="Focus Magic"},{["talentID"]=83,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12605,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Arcane Shielding",["nameRu"]="Arcane Shielding"},{["talentID"]=