Intellect",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Arcane Intellect"},{["itemID"]=43357,["spellID"]=57926,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorMage",["classToken"]="MAGE",["minLevel"]=20,["name"]="Glyph of Fire Ward",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Fire Ward"},{["itemID"]=43360,["spellID"]=57927,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorMage",["classToken"]="MAGE",["minLevel"]=22,["name"]="Glyph of Frost Ward",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Frost Ward"}},["glyphIssues"]={},["trees"]={"Arcane","Fire","Frost"},["source"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/fire-mage-pvp-guide",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/mage-talent-calculator#tc-001113334467779bbaauuvvvxxxxxyyAABBBCEFFIIIJLLLLLKKMMMNQQQPPSTTTUUUUUVO|0C1r2j3b4p5s"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/fire-mage-pvp-guide",["sha256"]="b4d9674687ff76371e32789f8c9d536bb27a9a3a43cd109f8ad1d5a230c27429",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="pvp",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=28271,["name"]="Polymorph",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Turtle",["conditionRu"]="Контроль второй цели; не ставьте на неё бомбу.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=55360,["name"]="Living Bomb",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_LivingBomb",["conditionRu"]="Давление; взрыв не должен сорвать контроль.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=11129,["name"]="Combustion",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SealOfFire",["conditionRu"]="Наступательное окно с напарником.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=47610,["name"]="Frostfire Bolt",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_FrostFireBolt",["conditionRu"]="Безопасное чтение в подготовленную цель.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=42891,["name"]="Pyroblast",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball02",["conditionRu"]="Обычно мгновенно под «Путём огня».",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=27079,["name"]="Fire Blast",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball",["conditionRu"]="Добивание или оглушение под «Сотрясением».",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["MAGE:Frost"]={["classToken"]="MAGE",["sourceSpec"]="Frost",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель льда с контролем и элементалем воды.","Контроль, выживаемость и удобство PvP.","В рейдах обычно уступает другим специализациям по урону."},["enUS"]={"Mage has three balanced PvE talent trees. This guide will lead you through the World of Frost Mage. If you wish to learn more about the other specs, try our Arcane and Fire guides. Each Mage spec has their own strengths and weaknesses for PvE","Best controlling, slowing, CCing abilities of all Mage specs. High burst damage for solo and group play. High survivability. Viable in PvP. Easier to gear than Fire Mages. Good Mana efficiency.","Not as good PvE damage as other Mage specs. Needs more Hit rating than Arcane spec."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Основное заклинание — ледяная стрела, элементаль должен атаковать. Используйте проки ледяных пальцев и заморозки мозгов; глубокая заморозка зависит от типа цели. Холодную хватку и стылую кровь планируйте под безопасное чтение.",["enUS"]="Frost Mages are capable of doing huge amounts of single-target burst damage, especially in short fights, due to the double use of Icy Veins and with Cold Snap. Your main rotation will be to Frostbolt while having your Water Elemental (Summon Water Elemental) up. With the Enduring Winter talent, Frostbolt a 100% chance to trigger the Replenishment buff on the lowest Mana raid members. If you get a Fingers of Frost proc, you want to cast 2x Frostbolt and after the 2nd Frostbolt spam press your Deep Freeze button. The spam-pressing of Deep Freeze is important, because then Fingers of Frost will benefit both the 2nd Frostbolt and Deep Freeze through the Shatter talent. When Brain Freeze procs, you cast an instant Frostfire Bolt, as Frostfire bolt scales with all Frost talents, while Fireball does not. If you ever need"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Build (18/0/53)",["talentsString"]="23000503110003--0533030311133100030152231351",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=74,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12592,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Arcane Subtlety",["nameRu"]="Arcane Subtlety"},{["talentID"]=76,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12840,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Arcane Focus",["nameRu"]="Arcane Focus"},{["talentID"]=75,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=12577,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Arcane Concentration",["nameRu"]="Arcane Concentration"},{["talentID"]=81,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12469,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Spell Impact",["nameRu"]="Spell Impact"},{["talentID"]=1845,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=44397,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Student of the Mind",["nameRu"]="Student of the Mind"},{["talentID"]=2211,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=54646,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Focus Magic",["nameRu"]="Focus Magic"},{["talentID"]=2222,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=55340,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Torment the Weak",["nameRu"]="Torment the Weak"},{["talentID"]=37,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16766,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Improved Frostbolt",["nameRu"]="Improved Frostbolt"},{["talentID"]=62,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=55094,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Ice Floes",["nameRu"]="Ice Floes"},{["talentID"]=73,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=15047,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=15,["ma