"]={["kind"]="pvp",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=33395,["name"]="Freeze",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostNova",["conditionRu"]="Заморозка питомца для подготовки урона.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=10180,["name"]="Frostbolt",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostBolt02",["conditionRu"]="Безопасное чтение по подготовленной цели.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=44572,["name"]="Deep Freeze",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_DeepFreeze",["conditionRu"]="Требуется замороженная цель или нужный прок; учитывайте иммунитеты.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=42914,["name"]="Ice Lance",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostBlast",["conditionRu"]="Мгновенный урон по замороженной цели или под проком.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["PALADIN:Holy"]={["classToken"]="PALADIN",["sourceSpec"]="Holy",["role"]="healer",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Лекарь с сильным направленным лечением и поддержкой группы.","Мощное лечение отдельной цели, благословения и защитные инструменты.","Ограниченная мобильность и лечение разрозненных целей."},["enUS"]={"Paladins are capable of filling all three roles in Wrath of the Lich King and are competitive at each. All of the specializations will allow you 3to fill a specific niche because of the plentiful buffs that no other class can offer.","Consistently powerful single-target healing with little set-up time. Scale extremely well with gear thanks to Holy Guidance. Strong buffs and utility such as Blessings, Auras, and wipe protection in Divine Intervention.","Ability to heal multiple targets is extremely limited due to only single-target, casted heals. Limited mobility makes movement challenging. Most powerful throughput cooldown Avenging Wrath limits usage of defensive cooldowns."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте частицу света на назначенной цели. Свет небес — основное направленное лечение; шок небес полезен на ходу и при срочной угрозе. Вспышку света выбирайте по времени до следующего урона, а не как безусловный заполнитель.",["enUS"]="Flash of Light is the spell you will cast the least. Due to a lack of an AoE or multi-target healing spell, Flash of Light is very useful for spot-healing, thanks to its quick cast but should be used only in a situation that you are certain you would not be able to finish a Holy Light cast. Holy Light is your largest, most powerful heal, and will be your default heal. You should be using almost exclusively Holy Light unless you are not confident you will be able to finish the cast. Casting Holy Light will grant you the Light's Grace buff, which makes the cast considerably faster. Using lower ranks is no longer a thing in Wrath of The Lich King as the Mana cost of spells is normalized, so make sure to always be using your maximum"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Build (52/19/0)",["talentsString"]="50350152020013053100515221-50320104202-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1432,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=20208,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Spiritual Focus",["nameRu"]="Spiritual Focus"},{["talentID"]=1444,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=20239,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Healing Light",["nameRu"]="Healing Light"},{["talentID"]=1449,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=20261,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Divine Intellect",["nameRu"]="Divine Intellect"},{["talentID"]=1435,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=31821,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Aura Mastery",["nameRu"]="Aura Mastery"},{["talentID"]=1461,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=20215,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Illumination",["nameRu"]="Illumination"