consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["PALADIN:Retribution"]={["classToken"]="PALADIN",["sourceSpec"]="Retribution",["role"]="melee",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Боец ближнего боя со светлой магией и поддержкой группы.","Управляемое окно урона, благословения и помощь союзникам.","Ограниченная мобильность; защиту нужно согласовывать с гневом карателя."},["enUS"]={"Paladins are capable of filling all three roles in Wrath and are competitive at each, melee DPS healer, and tank. Each specialization will allow you to fill a specific niche because of the plentiful buffs that no other class can offer.","Strong on-demand burst cooldown with Avenging Wrath. Multiple CC options in Hammer of Justice and Repentance. Strong buffs and utility such as Blessings, Auras, and wipe protection in Divine Intervention. Capable of off-healing in emergency situations. Spells are more potent","Limited mobility makes closing gaps difficult. Major defensive CDs cannot be used in conjunction with Avenging Wrath. Extremely vulnerable to incoming spell damage."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="По одной цели поддерживайте печать мщения/порчи, по нескольким — печать повиновения. Удар воина света, правосудие, божественная буря и освящение заполняют приоритет; экзорцизм — с мгновенным проком. Не переносите использование таунта с символом расплаты из Classic.",["enUS"]="If you have not already, please read the Spell Summary page. Knowing how each spell and ability works in detail will greatly increase your understanding of the topics discussed on this page. Retribution Paladin are one of the strongest melee DPS in the entire game not only because of the amazing buffs that they bring to any group or the utility they have with powerful abilities such as Hand of Protection but they do a massive amount of damage as well and are in contention for being the highest DPS melee class in the game especially early on. This guide assumes you are using the talent build that can be found at Talents page and are playing a max level character. If you are looking for leveling based help please refer to Leveling page for a leveling-specific rotation. The Retribution"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Personal damage + Aura Mastery",["titleRu"]="Личный урон + Мастер аур",["notes"]={["ruRU"]="Источник: очки в Свете усиливают личный урон и дают Мастера аур.",["enUS"]="Holy investment favors personal damage while retaining Aura Mastery."},["talentsString"]="053021-05-05232051203331302133231331",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1463,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=20332,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Seals of the Pure",["nameRu"]="Seals of the Pure"},{["talentID"]=1444,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=20239,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Healing Light",["nameRu"]="Healing Light"},{["talentID"]=1628,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=25836,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Unyielding Faith",["nameRu"]="Unyielding Faith"},{["talentID"]=1435,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=31821,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Aura Mastery",["nameRu"]="Aura Mastery"},{["talentID"]=2185,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=20266,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Divine Strength",["nameRu"]="Divine Strength"},{["talentID"]=1407,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=20105,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Benediction",["nameRu"]="Benediction"},{["talentID"]=1631,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=25957,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Judgements",["nameRu"]="Improved Judgements"},{["talentID"]=1464,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=20337,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Heart of the Crusader",["nameRu"]="Heart of the Crusader"},{["talentID"]=1401,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=20045,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Blessing of Might",["nameRu"]="Improved Blessing of Might"},{["talentID"]=1411,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=20121,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=20,["maxR