lOfMight",["conditionRu"]="Согласуйте оглушение и наступление с напарником.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=31884,["name"]="Avenging Wrath",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_AvengineWrath",["conditionRu"]="Окно урона; учитывайте ограничения защитных способностей.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=35395,["name"]="Crusader Strike",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_CrusaderStrike",["conditionRu"]="Атака доступной цели.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=53385,["name"]="Divine Storm",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Paladin_DivineStorm",["conditionRu"]="Не срывайте контроль соседних противников.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=48806,["name"]="Hammer of Wrath",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_ThunderClap",["conditionRu"]="Добивание при низком здоровье.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["PRIEST:Discipline"]={["classToken"]="PRIEST",["sourceSpec"]="Discipline",["role"]="healer",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Лекарь, предотвращающий урон щитами и реагирующий быстрым лечением.","Поглощение урона, сильное срочное лечение и внешняя защита.","Нужно предвидеть урон; несколько одинаковых лекарей мешают друг другу щитами."},["enUS"]={"Discipline Priest has been vastly improved in Wrath of the Lich King, becoming one of the most powerful healers in the game. As a Discipline Priest, you will primarily focus on buffing and rapidly healing injured allies.","Generally easy to gear, as most desired pieces are not wanted by others. Very high passive stats through talents, making them powerful in low gear. Great scaling throughout the entire expansion, remaining a competitive healing option. Powerful external raid cooldowns.","Requires knowing fights well to predict incoming damage. Does not do well with other Discipline Priests in the raid. Poor AoE healing in high damage situations."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Накладывайте щит до ожидаемого урона и при отсутствии ослабленной души. Исповедь — сильное срочное лечение; молитва восстановления используется по подходящей ситуации. Быстрое и связующее исцеление закрывают оставшийся урон.",["enUS"]="In Wrath of the Lich King, Discipline Priest has a very fast-paced, constant casting rotation. With the Borrowed Time and Enlightenment talents, you will easily reach the Global Cooldown casting cap of 1 second, allowing you to fire off multiple instant-cast spells back-to-back. Penance — Penance is extremely powerful, easily healing almost anyone to full in a very quick channel. This is the best spell to use whenever you need to quickly heal someone. Power Word: Shield — Casting this spell is the main priority of your spec. If you know someone will be taking damage soon, put a shield on them. If you do not have the Borrowed Time buff, prioritize this spell first. Prayer of Mending — This spell remains extremely powerful, even getting buffed in WotLK. Be sure to use this as much as possible. Renew —"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Builds for Discipline Priest in Wrath of the Lich King (57/14/0)",["talentsString"]="0503203130300512331323231251-23500103-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1898,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=52803,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Twin Disciplines",["nameRu"]="Twin Disciplines"},{["talentID"]=346,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14771,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Inner Fire",["nameRu"]="Improved Inner Fire"},{["talentID"]=344,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=14767,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Power Word: Fortitude",["nameRu"]="Improved Power Word: Fortitude"},{["talentID"]=347,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14777,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Meditation",["nameRu"]="Meditation"},{["talentID"]=348,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=14751,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Inner Focus",["nameRu"]="Inner Focus"},{["talentID"]=343,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14769,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Power Word: Shield",["nameRu"]="Improved Power Word: Shield"},{["talentID"]=341,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14781,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Mental Agility",["nameRu"]="Mental Agility"},{["talentID"]=1201,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=18555,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=30,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Mental Strength",["nameRu"]="Mental Strength"},{["talentID"]=351,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=63574,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=30,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Soul Warding",["nameRu"]="Soul Warding"},{["talentID"]=1771,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=33190,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=35,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Focused Power",["nameRu"]="Focused Power"},{["talentID"]=1772,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=34910,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=35,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Enlightenment",["nameRu"]="Enlightenment"},{["talentID"]=1858,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=45244,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=40,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Focused Will",["nameRu"]="Focused Will"},{["talentID"]=322,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=10060,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=40,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Power Infusion",["nameRu"]="Power Infusion"},{["talentID"]=1773,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=63506,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=40,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Flash Heal",["nameRu"]="Improved Flash Heal"},{["talentID"]=2235,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=57472,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=45,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Renewed Hope",["nameRu"]="Renewed Hope"},{["talentID"]=1896,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=47537,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=45,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Rapture",["nameRu"]="Rapture"},{["talentID"]=1894,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=47508,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=45,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Aspiration",["nameRu"]="Aspira