in a very quick channel. This is the best spell to use whenever you need to quickly heal someone."},{["spellID"]=10900,["name"]="Power Word: Shield",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PowerWordShield",["condition"]="Power Word: Shield — Casting this spell is the main priority of your spec. If you know someone will be taking damage soon, put a shield on them. If you do not have the Borrowed Time buff, prioritize this spell first."},{["spellID"]=48113,["name"]="Prayer of Mending",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PrayerOfMendingtga",["condition"]="Prayer of Mending — This spell remains extremely powerful, even getting buffed in WotLK. Be sure to use this as much as possible."},{["spellID"]=10929,["name"]="Renew",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Renew",["condition"]="Renew — Remains a powerful heal-over-time. Be sure to keep this on targets you know will be taking constant damage."},{["spellID"]=48063,["name"]="Greater Heal",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_GreaterHeal",["condition"]="Greater Heal — A slow, but powerful heal. Use this when a big burst of damage is about to land on a target, or if the target will not die before the longer cast time ends and needs a large heal."},{["spellID"]=25235,["name"]="Flash Heal",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_FlashHeal",["condition"]="Flash Heal — This is your main filler spell, doing moderate healing to a target quickly."},{["spellID"]=48120,["name"]="Binding Heal",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_BlindingHeal",["condition"]="Binding Heal — Essentially the same as Flash Heal, but heals you as well as the target. Use this instead if you are missing health."}}}},["pvp"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Лекарь с поглощением, активным снятием эффектов и контролем.","Разнообразный набор ответов и сильные защитные кулдауны.","Нужно планировать ману, позицию и уязвимые чтения."},["enUS"]={"Discipline Priest is a powerful healing option in Wrath of the Lich King PvP, having multiple powerful cooldowns as well as a very diverse toolkit that fits almost every situation.","Strong cooldowns that can be used defensively or offensively. Wide array of spells available, often having something useful in every situation. Both offensive and defensive magic dispels. Versatile playstyle that fits in well with almost any other class.","Considerably weaker when major spells are on cooldown. Limited crowd control abilities; can only really focus on healing. Very immobile; difficult to escape from enemies when they get on you."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Предупреждайте урон щитами и лечите срочные цели исповедью. Снятие опасных эффектов и контроль должны помогать напарнику; опасное чтение лучше подготовить позиционированием или ложным началом заклинания.",["enUS"]=""},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Talent Build For PvP Discipline Priest in Wrath of the Lich King (57/14/0)",["talentsString"]="5033103130302512331013231251-20350103-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=342,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=14791,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Unbreakable Will",["nameRu"]="Unbreakable Will"},{["talentID"]=352,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14785,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Silent Resolve",["nameRu"]="Silent Resolve"},{["talentID"]=346,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14771,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Inner Fire",["nameRu"]="Improved Inner Fire"},{["talentID"]=344,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=14749,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Power Word: Fortitude",["nameRu"]="Improved Power Word: Fortitude"},{["talentID"]=347,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14777,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Meditation",["nameRu"]="Meditation"},{["talentID"]=348,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=14751,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Inner Focus",["nameRu"]="Inner Focus"},{["talentID"]=343,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14769,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Power Word: Shield",[