f Healing",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Circle of Healing"},{["itemID"]=42409,["spellID"]=55680,["category"]="major",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MajorPriest",["classToken"]="PRIEST",["minLevel"]=30,["name"]="Glyph of Prayer of Healing",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Prayer of Healing"},{["itemID"]=42400,["spellID"]=55679,["category"]="major",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MajorPriest",["classToken"]="PRIEST",["minLevel"]=20,["name"]="Glyph of Flash Heal",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Flash Heal"},{["itemID"]=43371,["spellID"]=58009,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorPriest",["classToken"]="PRIEST",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Fortitude",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Fortitude"},{["itemID"]=43372,["spellID"]=58015,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorPriest",["classToken"]="PRIEST",["minLevel"]=30,["name"]="Glyph of Shadow Protection",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Shadow Protection"},{["itemID"]=43370,["spellID"]=57987,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorPriest",["classToken"]="PRIEST",["minLevel"]=34,["name"]="Glyph of Levitate",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Levitate"}},["glyphIssues"]={},["trees"]={"Discipline","Holy","Shadow"},["source"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/holy-priest-healer-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/priest-talent-calculator#tc-sstttuuuuuwwwwwAAzzzDDEFFFFFHHHHHGGIIINNNPOOORRRRRS111114433366678aaaKK|0x1s2l3c4t5v"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/holy-priest-healer-pve-guide",["sha256"]="0facbfd9d1d369ed08e5d18261f0fac8bb4742c3ffc5e2afc82dbf7f5e8b760f",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/holy-priest-healer-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["sha256"]="6ce031f1d62db8a1e2f6490643d1091a8ae98643e3ae30b2fff25fc28f46a04a",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/holy-priest-healer-pve-rotation-cooldowns-abilities",["sha256"]="7909ede8607ba38691cb7c219645dc2599910a2e4a164803117c7b156aba87a7",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="priority",["heading"]="Single-Target Rotation for Holy Priest in Wrath of the Lich King",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=10929,["name"]="Renew",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Renew",["condition"]="Renew — Remains a powerful heal-over-time. Be sure to keep this on targets you know will be taking constant damage."},{["spellID"]=48113,["name"]="Prayer of Mending",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PrayerOfMendingtga",["condition"]="Prayer of Mending — This spell remains extremely powerful, even getting buffed in WotLK. Be sure to use this as much as possible."},{["spellID"]=48063,["name"]="Greater Heal",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_GreaterHeal",["condition"]="Greater Heal — A slow, but powerful heal. Use this when a big burst of damage is about to land on a target, or if the target will not die before the longer cast time ends and needs a large heal."},{["spellID"]=25235,["name"]="Flash Heal",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_FlashHeal",["condition"]="Flash Heal — This is your main filler spell, doing moderate healing to a target quickly."},{["spellID"]=48120,["name"]="Binding Heal",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_BlindingHeal",["condition"]="Binding Heal — Essentially the same as Flash Heal, but heals you as well as the target. Use this instead if you are missing health."}}}}},["PRIEST:Shadow"]={["classToken"]="PRIEST",["sourceSpec"]="Shadow",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель с периодическим уроном и поддержкой группы.","Полезные ослабления, восполнение маны и защитная дисперсия.","Требуется разгон урона; частая смена целей мешает."},["enUS"]={"Shadow Priest receives many, vast improvements in Wrath of the Lich King, going from being a bottom-of-the-meters support DPS to a full fledged damage dealer. Shadow Priest excels in fights with multiple targets, allowing them to keep their DoTs up on as many targets as","Received many quality of life improves in WotLK, greatly improving their gameplay. Provides powerful utility with both Replenishment and Misery. Many possibilities with Dispersion to solo raid mechanics that usually require multiple players.","High ramp-up damage, doing poorly in shorter fights. Mid-level AoE, not really scaling all that well. High competition on caster loot."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте прикосновение вампира и всепожирающую чуму; обновление боли связано с талантами. Взрыв разума используйте с учётом бонусов комплекта, пытка разума заполняет паузы. Не обрывайте канал между полезными тиками.",["enUS"]="Unlike most other classes, your rotation does not really differ between AoE and single-target. It mostly comes down to how long the mobs will live and how many mobs there are. If there are a few mobs that will live long, you will follow the single-target damage rotation. If there is a big pack of mobs that will die quickly, you will use your AoE. Vampiric Touch — This is your main priority to keep up. Whenever you use Mind Blast while Vampiric Touch is up, you will buff up to 10 players with Replenishment. Devouring Plague — A huge part of your damage, be sure to keep it up as much as possible. The combination of this being an instant-cast spell and the Improved Devouring Plague talent make this a decent spell to cast when moving. Mind Blast —"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Builds for Shadow Priest in Wrath of the Lich King (14/0/57)",["talentsString"]="05032031--325023051223010223152301351",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1898,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=52803,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Twin Disciplines",["nameRu"]="Twin Disciplines"},{["talentID"]=346,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=14771,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Inner Fire",["nameRu"]="Improved Inner Fire"},{["talentID"]=344,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=14767,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank