rred Speed",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Blurred Speed"}},["glyphIssues"]={},["trees"]={"Assassination","Combat","Subtlety"},["source"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/subtlety-rogue-pvp-guide",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/rogue-talent-calculator#tc-rrr220005553336TTTTTUVVXXZZ...~~~[[())%EF%BD%A6%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%AB%EF%BD%AB%EF%BD%AB%EF%BD%AA%EF%BD%AC%EF%BD%AC%EF%BD%AC%EF%BD%AC%EF%BD%AC%EF%BD%AD%EF%BD%AD%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AF%EF%BD%B1%EF%BD%B1%EF%BD%B1%EF%BD%B1%EF%BD%B1%EF%BD%B0%EF%BD%B0%EF%BD%A7%EF%BD%A7%EF%BD%A7Y%EF%BD%B2|0G2C3t4s5b1w"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/subtlety-rogue-pvp-guide",["sha256"]="a1f692196049f1262fe0600dbf40777959749037d83d7ab81ebdf285df6820c0",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="pvp",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=8643,["name"]="Kidney Shot",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_KidneyShot",["conditionRu"]="Подготовьте окно урона; нужны приёмы, учитывайте предыдущие оглушения.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=51713,["name"]="Shadow Dance",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_ShadowDance",["conditionRu"]="Наступление по подготовленной цели.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=1766,["name"]="Kick",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Kick",["conditionRu"]="Прерывание важного чтения.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=26889,["name"]="Vanish",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Vanish",["conditionRu"]="Повторное открытие или защита; не тратьте автоматически.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["SHAMAN:Elemental"]={["classToken"]="SHAMAN",["sourceSpec"]="Elemental",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель дальнего боя с огненными и природными заклинаниями.","Простой основной приоритет, мощные усиления группы и массовый урон.","Низкая мобильность и уязвимость при прерывании чтения."},["enUS"]={"Elemental Shaman is an excellent support caster in Wrath Classic, having good ranged DPS on their own which starts off strong due to their strong talent tree, but scales worse than other casters in the long run.","Able to burst on demand with Elemental Mastery. Great AoE DPS and damage scaling, with a simple rotation. Shared gear with Restoration allows for easy swapping between healing and damage between encounters.","Low mobility and survivability. Simple rotation can lead to boring gameplay."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Держите огненный шок до завершения выброса лавы. Затем выбирайте цепную молнию при достаточной мане и молнию. На нескольких целях используйте подходящие тотемы и кольцо огня; не теряйте основные усиления группы.",["enUS"]="We will present the skill rotation of an Elemental Shaman as a priority list. This is not an exact sequence in which abilities should be cast. Instead, what it means is that whenever you must choose between using different skills, try to use the one at the top of the list first. Our recommendations assume you are running one of the recommended talent builds from the talents page and are playing a max level character. If you are still leveling, please refer to the leveling page for a leveling-specific rotation. Try to start every fight with Totem of Wrath, even if you have 2,800+ Spell Power Demonology Warlocks in your group using Demonic Pact (at which point its buff is superior), as it will buff the effect of the first Demonic Pact. You can swap to Searing Totem once Demonic"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Elemental Shaman PvE Talents and Build (57/14/0)",["talentsString"]="0533001523213351322301351-005050031-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=563,["rank"]=5,["spe