ное чтение.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["SHAMAN:Enhancement"]={["classToken"]="SHAMAN",["sourceSpec"]="Enhancement",["role"]="melee",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Гибридный боец ближнего боя с оружейными и магическими атаками.","Массовый урон и богатая поддержка тотемами.","Сложный приоритет; требуется время в ближнем бою и контроль нескольких ресурсов."},["enUS"]={"Enhancement Shaman is arguably the highest skill cap melee specialization in Wrath Classic, alongside Feral DPS Druid. Fortunately, it is still possible to do well while learning the details, especially when dealing AoE damage, which is where Enhancement excels!","High skill cap and engaging rotation. Excellent area damage and good single-target. Fantastic support capabilities through Bloodlust/Heroism, Wrath of Air Totem, Windfury Totem, Strength of Earth Totem, and others.","Melee requirement for most of rotation can be awkward in some bosses. Low single-target DPS if complex rotation is not performed optimally. High amount of Spell Damage dealt causes Armor Penetration to be a bad stat, causing scaling issues in"}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте тотемы и щит молний. Удар бури, огненный шок, магматический тотем и кольцо огня входят в приоритет. Молнию/цепную молнию используйте со стаками оружия водоворота без потери автоатак; вскипание лавы — низкий приоритет.",["enUS"]="We will present the skill rotation of an Enhancement Shaman as a priority list. This is not an exact sequence in which abilities should be cast. Instead what it means is that whenever you must choose between using different skills, try to use the one at the top of the list first. Our recommendations assume you are running one of the recommended talent builds from the talents page and are playing a max level character. If you are still leveling, please refer to the leveling page for a leveling-specific rotation. As one of the most complex specializations to perform an ideal rotation with in Wrath, there are two critical concepts to understand (coupled with Macros and WeakAuras to help you optimize them) before getting into the ability priority list. Weapon Sync means that your main-hand and off-hand weapons are swinging"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Enhancement Shaman PvE Physical / Single Talent Build (20/51/0)",["talentsString"]="052330052-30505013005001333031131031051-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=563,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16108,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Concussion",["nameRu"]="Concussion"},{["talentID"]=561,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16160,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Call of Flame",["nameRu"]="Call of Flame"},{["talentID"]=1640,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=28998,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Elemental Warding",["nameRu"]="Elemental Warding"},{["talentID"]=1645,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=29180,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Elemental Devastation",["nameRu"]="Elemental Devastation"},{["talentID"]=565,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=60188,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Elemental Fury",["nameRu"]="Elemental Fury"},{["talentID"]=567,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16544,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Fire Nova",["nameRu"]="Improved Fire Nova"},{["talentID"]=610,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=52456,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Enhancing Totems",["nameRu"]="Enhancing Totems"},{["talentID"]=614,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=17489,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Ancestral Knowledge",["nameRu"]="Ancestral Knowledge"},{["talentID"]=613,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16305,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Thundering Strikes",["nameRu"]="Thundering Strikes"},{["talentID"]=607,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=16261,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Shields",["nameRu"]="Improved Shields"},{["talentID"]=611,["ran