остью срочного лечения.","Может менять наступление на поддержку, восстанавливая тотемы быстро.","Нужно поддерживать контакт с целью и контролировать несколько инструментов."},["enUS"]={"Enhancement Shamans are, unfortunately, not a meta class in the Arena. This is mostly due to the lack of a Mortal Strike effect, but weakness against kiting and having Hex as their only crowd control ability does not help.","",""}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Расходуйте доступные мгновенные заклинания на урон либо лечение по ситуации. Поддерживайте нужные тотемы, используйте защиту тотемов и не отдавайте все возможности остановки противника одновременно.",["enUS"]="Rather than a fixed rotation, Shaman gameplay is about treading a fine balance between casting damage spells, utility spells, and even healing when needed. Here are some quick tips: Keep yourself and your allies alive and enemies in range with Frost Shock, Earthbind Totem, Grounding Totem, and Lesser Healing Wave or Healing Wave when supported by Maelstrom Weapon; Pressure enemies with your melee abilities, Maelstrom Weapon-fueled Lightning Bolts and Chain Lightnings, and also with Feral Spirit, Purge, Bloodlust, and Wind Shear; Keep an eye on your Mana pool, and use Shamanistic Rage as needed, preferably also using it as a defensive measure in the process. Totem stomping is no longer a big deal in Wrath, as Stoneclaw Totem protects them and Call of the Elements can instantly place up to four new totems if your current ones are destroyed, making"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Enhancement Shaman Standard PvP Talents (17/54/0)",["talentsString"]="0503351-02305203105001333211131231251-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=563,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16108,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Concussion",["nameRu"]="Concussion"},{["talentID"]=1640,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=28998,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Elemental Warding",["nameRu"]="Elemental Warding"},{["