%BD%A6%EF%BD%A7%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%AA%EF%BD%AA%EF%BD%AA%EF%BD%AB%EF%BD%AC%EF%BD%AB%EF%BD%AB%EF%BD%AD%EF%BD%AD%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AE%EF%BD%AFqqrrrttsuuxsvvvVtt|0z1i3j4o5q2d"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/restoration-shaman-pvp-guide",["sha256"]="5405cfc235b9c6167512cf6d8be5602fb58e78b0554398b16ba3a13b77a4293e",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="pvp",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=974,["name"]="Earth Shield",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_SkinofEarth",["conditionRu"]="Заранее защищайте основную цель давления.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=61295,["name"]="Riptide",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\spell_nature_riptide",["conditionRu"]="Мгновенное лечение и поддержка.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=49276,["name"]="Lesser Healing Wave",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_HealingWaveLesser",["conditionRu"]="Безопасное быстрое чтение.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."},{["spellID"]=57994,["name"]="Wind Shear",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Cyclone",["conditionRu"]="Прерывание, если это не мешает спасти союзника.",["condition"]="Situational ability: consider the PvP priorities above, control and defensive cooldowns."}}}}},["WARLOCK:Affliction"]={["classToken"]="WARLOCK",["sourceSpec"]="Affliction",["role"]="ranged",["pve"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель с периодическим уроном и усиленным добиванием.","Длительный урон, несколько одновременно поражённых целей, сильная завершающая фаза.","Медленный разгон и мало мгновенного взрывного урона."},["enUS"]={"Affliction Warlock is widely known as one of the best specializations in Wrath of the Lich King. Highly focused on their array of damage-over-time abilities, known as DoTs, Affliction Warlock prefers to sit back and watch their enemies rot away slowly. A dominant force in","Excellent single-target damage output. Excels in multi-DoT situations. Extremely strong damage during execute phase.","Due to being a DoT spec, you have a slow ramp-up time. Absolutely no burst. Harder rotation."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте блуждающий дух, нестабильное колдовство, порчу и подходящее проклятие. Стрела тьмы заполняет паузы; в завершающей фазе усиливается похищение души. Учитывайте усиления при наложении периодических эффектов.",["enUS"]="The Affliction Warlock rotation is one of the most fun and engaging rotations in the game, having to keep up all your damage-over-time abilities on top of Haunt to buff them all up while filling with Shadow Bolt in the meantime. This page will go over the single-0target rotation, as well as the AoE and execute rotations Your opener as Affliction matters a lot in terms of both damage. It is very important Life Tap for your Glyph — This needs to be up the entire fight. Remember, if you have the 4-piece Tier 7 set bonus, do not worry about life tapping to keep that 4pc buff. Just Life Tap throughout the fight as you normally would. Pre-Pot a potion — Potion of Wild Magic. The crit rating on this will snapshot into your Corruption Precast your Shadow Bolt"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Builds for Affliction Warlocks in Wrath of the Lich King (55/0/16)",["talentsString"]="2350002030023510253500331151--550000051",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1284,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=18829,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Curse of Agony",["nameRu"]="Improved Curse of Agony"},{["talentID"]=1005,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=18176,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Suppression",["nameRu"]="Suppression"},{["talentID"]=1003,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=17814,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Improved Corruption",["nameRu"]="Improved Corruption"},{["talentID"]=1004,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=17805,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Soul Siphon",["nameRu"]="Soul Siphon"},{["talentID"]=1001,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=17785,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Fel Concentration",["nameRu"]="Fel Concentration"},{["talentID"]=1002,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=18095,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Nightfall",["nameRu"]="Nightfall"},{["talentID"]=1764,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=32383,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Empowered Corruption",["nameRu"]="Empowered Corruption"},{["talentID"]=1763,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=32394,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=30,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Shadow Embrace",["nameRu"]="Shadow Embrace"},{["talentID"]=1041,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=63108,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=30,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Siphon Life",["nameRu"]="Siphon Life"},{["talentID"]=1873,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=54038,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=35,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Felhunter",["nameRu"]="Improved Felhunter"},{["talentID"]=1042,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=18275,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=35,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Shadow Mastery",["nameRu"]="Shadow Mastery"},{["talentID"]=1878,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=47197,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=40,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Eradication",["nameRu"]="Eradication"},{["talentID"]=1669,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=30064,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=40,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Contagion",["nameRu"]="Contagion"},{["talentID"]=1667,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=32484,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=45,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Malediction",["nameRu"]="Malediction"},{["talentID"]=1875,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=47200,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=50,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Death's Embrace",["nameRu"]="Death's Embrace"},{["talentID"]=1670,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=30108,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=50,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Unstable Affliction",["nameRu"]="Unstable Affliction"},{["talentID"]=2245,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=58435,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=50,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Pandemic",["nameRu"]="Pandemic"},{["talentID"]=1876,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=47205,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=55,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Everlasting Affliction",["nameRu"]="Everlasting Affliction"},{["talentID"]=2041,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=48181,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=60,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Haunt",["nameRu"]="Haunt"},{["talentID"]=944,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=17803,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Improved Shadow Bolt",["nameRu"]="Improved Shadow Bolt"},{["talentID"]=943,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=17792,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Bane",["nameRu"]="Bane"},{["talentID"]=967,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=59741,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Ruin",["nameRu"]="Ruin"},{["talentID"]=985,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=18135,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Intensity",["nameRu"]="Intensity"}},["glyphs"]={{["itemID"]=45785,["spellID"]=63320,["category"]="major",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MajorWarlock",["classToken"]="WARLOCK",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Life Tap",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Life Tap"},{["itemID"]=45779,["spellID"]=63302,["category"]="major",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MajorWarlock",["classToken"]="WARLOCK",["minLevel"]=60,["name"]="Glyph of Haunt",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Haunt"},{["itemID"]=50077,["spellID"]=70947,["category"]="major",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MajorWarlock",["classToken"]="WARLOCK",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Quick Decay",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Quick Decay"},{["itemID"]=43390,["spellID"]=58070,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorWarlock",["classToken"]="WARLOCK",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Drain Soul",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Drain Soul"},{["itemID"]=43389,["spellID"]=58079,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorWarlock",["classToken"]="WARLOCK",["minLevel"]=15,["name"]="Glyph of Unending Breath",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Unending Breath"},{["itemID"]=43394,["spellID"]=58094,["category"]="minor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Glyph_MinorWarlock",["classToken"]="WARLOCK",["minLevel"]=68,["name"]="Glyph of Souls",["nameRu"]="Glyph of Souls"}},["glyphIssues"]={},["trees"]={"Affliction","Demonology","Destruction"},["source"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/affliction-warlock-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/warlock-talent-calculator#tc-TTTTTUUUUU-0022222661888bbcccedddddhhhhhjjjjjiiimmmnnnopqqqqqr11----gg.|0i1D2j3c4l5F"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/affliction-warlock-dps-pve-guide",["sha256"]="81c3814adce42eed6188477ee293b5bc8f72a70b4b6d2dfd86b46bd507674c90",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/affliction-warlock-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["sha256"]="0c3215d7aa039b4eb6e1960c0f0416aa295f2db1cbdc627bf5490c7f5f54fe9d",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/affliction-warlock-dps-pve-rotation-cooldowns-abilities",["sha256"]="72b9a10541f01bd81ece726006d135b8d8d273bc3367db0bdec06fcc245f66d8",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="priority",["heading"]="Affliction Warlock Single-Target Damage Rotation in Wrath of the Lich King",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=48181,["name"]="Haunt",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warlock_Haunt",["condition"]="After the opening Shadow Bolt, cast Haunt and keep this on the target at all times, while trying not to clip it. Clipping means to reapply before the previous DoT ran out."},{["spellID"]=30108,["name"]="Unstable Affliction",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnstableAffliction_3",["condition"]="Cast Unstable Affliction and keep this on the target at all times."},{["spellID"]=47812,["name"]="Corruption",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AbominationExplosion",["condition"]="Cast Corruption. This is cast after Haunt and Unstable Affliction to ensure that you have Improved Shadow Bolt and Tricks of the Trade."},{["spellID"]=47864,["name"]="Curse of Agony",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfSargeras",["condition"]="Cast Curse of Agony and keep this on the target at all times."},{["spellID"]=11661,["name"]="Shadow Bolt",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt",["condition"]="Fill with Shadow Bolt while keeping Haunt, Unstable Affliction and Curse of Agony on the target for the entire duration of the encounter without clipping them."}}}},["pvp"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Заклинатель с распределённым периодическим давлением и контролем.","Давление на несколько целей и защита эффектов нестабильным колдовством.","Сложное управление эффектами, позиционированием и контролем."},["enUS"]={"Affliction Warlock is one of the most difficult but rewarding and strong PvP specs in the game. Dealing extremely high spread pressure while maintaining control on the enemy and being incredibly durable, an Affliction Warlock is one of the most feared specs in PvP.","High spread pressure against multiple enemies. Great disruption and crowd control. Ability to protect important debuffs and CC from being dispelled.","Heavily dependent on having a pet alive for durability. Prone to being interrupted due to one school for casting. Pressure based and needs time to ramp up."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте периодические эффекты на нескольких целях и связывайте страх с нестабильным колдовством против снятия. Создавайте давление и мешайте противнику отвечать, не заменяя всё чтением урона в одну цель.",["enUS"]="Affliction Warlocks do not have a set rotation, but raher a priority system. The playstyle should emphasise maintaining DoTs on as many targets as possible while disruption and control are the primary goal. An Affliction Warlock should try to always keep someone in a Fear while covered by Unstable Affliction to protect it from dispels. Apply Curse of Tongues to enemy healer and casters. Apply Curse of the Elements to kill targets and melee. Apply Unstable Affliction to a target you want to CC. Cast Fear to the target you want to CC. Cast Corruption on all enemies. Cast Unstable Affliction on all enemies. Cast Haunt on your kill target. Cast Drain Life as a filler once all your DoTs and Haunt are up. Cast Drain Soul when your enemy target is under 25% to execute. If Fear is dispelled"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Talent Build For PvP Affliction Warlock in Wrath of the Lich King (52/17/2)",["talentsString"]="0350002231223111053502301151-0032203011302-2",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=1005,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=18176,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Suppression",["nameRu"]="Suppression"},{["talentID"]=1003,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=17814,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Improved Corruption",["nameRu"]="Improved Corruption"},{["talentID"]=1004,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=17805,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Soul Siphon",["nameRu"]="Soul Siphon"},{["talentID"]=2205,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=53759,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Fear",["nameRu"]="Improved Fear"},{["talentID"]=1001,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=17785,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Fel Concentration",["nameRu"]="Fel Concentration"},{["talentID"]=1061,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=18288,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=1,["name"]="Amplify Curse",["nameRu"]="Amplify Curse"},{["talentID"]=1021,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=18219,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Grim Reach",["nameRu"]="Grim Reach"},{["talentID"]=1002,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=18095,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Nightfall",["nameRu"]="Nightfall"},{["talentID"]=1764,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=32383,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Empowered Corruption",["nameRu"]="Empowered Corruption"},{["talentID"]=1763,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=32385,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=30,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Shadow Embrace",["nameRu"]="Shadow Embrace"},{["talentID"]=1041,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=63108,["tree"]