Arms","Fury","Protection"},["source"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/arms-warrior-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/warrior-talent-calculator#tc-xxxxxvvvYYYWWZZZ00022335556688999aaabbbcccccdgiimmllknoooppqqqrsstttttu|0h1y2s3m4F5I"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/arms-warrior-dps-pve-guide",["sha256"]="e8ea9e75616bbf43a946c92a267e229d6608a16d756d05c2c23b648e0033d01d",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/arms-warrior-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["sha256"]="4739b9a2ca59d693fe47087d6589eeb28397ae8b7e27b51a4bb7d7494a3cd3a0",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/arms-warrior-dps-pve-rotation-cooldowns-abilities",["sha256"]="33fce54d6c0298807d4fb8426aa9b161b980f8736e1d59ffaa787d65ba7f5507",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="priority",["heading"]="Arms Warrior Single-Target Damage Rotation in Wrath of the Lich King",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=7386,["name"]="Sunder Armor",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Sunder",["condition"]="Sunder Armor — Sunder Armor remains your best opening ability on bosses, increasing all Physical damage taken. You do not need to do this if someone else, such as a Rogue, is applying an Armor reduction debuff."},{["spellID"]=46845,["name"]="Rend",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Gouge",["condition"]="Rend — You must always maintain an active Rend on a target to get Taste for Blood procs, allowing you to use Overpower."},{["spellID"]=7384,["name"]="Overpower",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_MeleeDamage",["condition"]="Overpower — Be sure to use Overpower as often as possible to prevent a Taste for Blood proc from going to waste."},{["spellID"]=46924,["name"]="Bladestorm",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Bladestorm",["condition"]="Bladestorm — This is your next priority as it deals high damage and you want to get it on cooldown as soon as possible. Ideally this would line up with your trinket procs or on-use trinkets."},{["spellID"]=47471,["name"]="Execute",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_48",["condition"]="Execute — Even with Execute being nerfed in WotLK, it remains a high priority for Arms Warriors. Use it with Sudden Death procs or if the target is below 20% health."},{["spellID"]=12294,["name"]="Mortal Strike",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_SavageBlow",["condition"]="Mortal Strike — Now is the time to Mortal Strike since all of your procs have been managed at this point. Mortal Strike will bypass Slam if you are moving."},{["spellID"]=47475,["name"]="Slam",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DecisiveStrike",["condition"]="Slam — Slam deals decent damage even with it slightly delaying your next auto attack. Be sure to weave them in whenever you have nothing higher priority to use and no procs."},{["spellID"]=25286,["name"]="Heroic Strike",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Ambush",["condition"]="Heroic Strike — Finally you will start to use Heroic Strike whenever you have more than 40 Rage as it deals good damage."}}}},["pvp"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Боец ближнего боя с давлением и снижением эффективности лечения.","Сближение, прерывания и инструменты удержания инициативы.","Требует грамотного выбора цели, позиции и обмена защитой."},["enUS"]={"Arms Warrior is a high damage melee class, dishing out massive damage while having moderately high utility. With multiple gap closers, interrupts, a few crowd-controls, and healing reduction, Arms Warrior remains a powerhouse in any PvP environment.","Not limited by resources such as Mana; can fight forever. Has high burst damage windows constantly, allowing you to catch enemies off-guard. Keeps enemies healing received constantly reduced by 50%, can not be removed unlike other healing reductions.","Very one-sided gameplay, does not bring much besides damage dealing. Limited mobility, very susceptible to being kited. Very gear dependent; requires multiple end-game items from PvP and PvE to perform. Reliant on constant support from others to avoid being trivialized."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Поддерживайте снижение лечения, замедляйте цель и согласуйте наступление с напарником. Переключайте стойки и защиту по ситуации; прерывание и контроль используйте для завершения атаки, а не просто по восстановлению.",["enUS"]=""},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Talent Build For PvP Arms Warrior in Wrath of the Lich King (60/11/0)",["talentsString"]="0320332023335100232212013231251-3250001-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=130,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=16464,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Deflection",["nameRu"]="Deflection"},{["talentID"]=127,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12658,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Rend",["nameRu"]="Improved Rend"},{["talentID"]=641,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12960,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Iron Will",["nameRu"]="Iron Will"},{["talentID"]=128,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12677,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Tactical Mastery",["nameRu"]="Tactical Mastery"},{["talentID"]=131,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12963,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Overpower",["nameRu"]="Improved Overpower"},{["talentID"]=662,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16494,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Impale",["nameRu"]="Impale"},{["talentID"]=121,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12867,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Deep Wounds",["nameRu"]="Deep Wounds"},{["talentID"]=136,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12712,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Two-Handed Weapon Specialization",["nameRu"]="Two-Handed Weapon Specialization"},{["talentID"]=2232,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=56638,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Taste for Blood",["nameRu"]="Taste for Blood"},{["talentID"]=132,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=12785,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"