ец ближнего боя с двумя двуручными оружиями.","Сильное масштабирование, урон по одной и нескольким близким целям.","Высокая зависимость от экипировки и двух хороших оружий."},["enUS"]={"Fury Warrior maintains its simple, yet satisfying gameplay in Wrath of the Lich King while receiving some exciting new features and great quality of life improvements. Fury Warrior excels in multi-target scenarios, being one of the highest sustained cleave damage dealers out there.","Great scaling with high level gear. Top damage against 3-4 targets with consistent cleave. Top single-target damage in end-game content. Not reliant on resources; can sustain combat infinitely. Satisfying, simple rotation that feels rewarding to play.","Very gear dependent, being nearly unplayable without full raiding gear. Brings no utility to the raid, only damage. Requires 2 Two-handed weapons, whereas other specs only require 1."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Кровожадность и вихрь — основные атаки; мощный удар используйте с мгновенным проком прилива крови. Удар героя расходует избыток ярости, рассекающий удар заменяет его на нескольких целях. Не оставляйте основные атаки без ресурса.",["enUS"]="The Fury Warrior rotation is very simple yet satisfying to play. Your rotation is nearly completely set-in-stone, only varying based on your Bloodsurge procs, which give you instant Slam casts. Overall, Fury Warrior is a fast-paced, high-action rotation that yields great results. Sunder Armor — Sunder Armor remains your best opening ability on bosses, increasing all Physical damage taken. You do not need to do this if someone else, such as a Rogue, is applying an Expose Armor. Slam — You will want to use Slam as quicly as possible whenever you get a Bloodsurge proc. Be aware of your buffs and do not use Slam without a Bloodsurge proc as it will not be instant cast and will pause your melee swing timer. Bloodthirst — This spell is the bread and butter of a Fury Warrior's rotation. It has"},["builds"]={{["key"]="pve_0",["title"]="Talent Builds for Fury Warrior in Wrath of the Lich King (20/51/0)",["talentsString"]="302023102331-325001005500310053120501351-",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=124,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12664,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Improved Heroic Strike",["nameRu"]="Improved Heroic Strike"},{["talentID"]=127,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12658,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Rend",["nameRu"]="Improved Rend"},{["talentID"]=641,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12959,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Iron Will",["nameRu"]="Iron Will"},{["talentID"]=128,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12677,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Tactical Mastery",["nameRu"]="Tactical Mastery"},{["talentID"]=131,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=12290,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Overpower",["nameRu"]="Improved Overpower"},{["talentID"]=662,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16494,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Impale",["nameRu"]="Impale"},{["talentID"]=121,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12867,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Deep Wounds",["nameRu"]="Deep Wounds"},{["talentID"]=136,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12712,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Two-Handed Weapon Specialization",["nameRu"]="Two-Handed Weapon Specialization"},{["talentID"]=2232,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=56636,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=25,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Taste for Blood",["nameRu"]="Taste for Blood"},{["talentID"]=2250,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=61222,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Armored to the Teeth",["nameRu"]="Armored to the Teeth"},{["talentID"]=158,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12835,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Booming Voice",["nameRu"]="Booming Voice"},{["talentID"]=157,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=12856,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Cruelty",["nameRu"]="Cruelty"},{["talentID"]=166,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=12329,["tree"]=2,[