warrior-tank-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["calculator"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/warrior-talent-calculator#tc-11111444555788999000dcccccggiikllXXXXXZZZ-----.__~~[[[[[%EF%BD%A7%EF%BD%A8%EF%BD%A9%EF%BD%A9%EF%BD%A9%EF%BD%A9%EF%BD%A9%EF%BD%AA%EF%BD%AApn33p%EF%BD%AB|0u1q3m4c5b2z"}},["sources"]={{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/protection-warrior-tank-pve-guide",["sha256"]="0af589fb3990e7941f9570e97f82e53a6694fc991d4f39421c4decda3916c9dd",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/protection-warrior-tank-pve-spec-builds-talents-glyphs",["sha256"]="83de9f9414ebf0a01606d728a67235a973e7a742789ec6e45c15359f9ff95ac1",["date"]="2026-10-19"},{["url"]="https://www.icy-veins.com/wotlk-classic/protection-warrior-tank-pve-rotation-cooldowns-abilities",["sha256"]="13df83da4089559a5acf0d1b0e02564c72d490d0962e218a795e9c1207cfe3a5",["date"]="2026-10-19"}},["rotationDiagram"]={["kind"]="priority",["heading"]="Protection Warrior Single-Target Tanking Rotation in Wrath of the Lich King",["steps"]={{["spellID"]=47488,["name"]="Shield Slam",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Shield_05",["condition"]="Shield Slam when Shield Block is active — Thanks to Shield Block doubling your Block Value and allowing Shield Slam to bypass the Block Value cap on your Shield Slam damage, you will want to prioritize using it over Revenge in a pure single-target situation while your Shield Block is active."},{["spellID"]=57823,["name"]="Revenge",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Revenge",["condition"]="Revenge — Revenge is your highest-damage ability thanks to Improved Revenge, and is only slightly behind Shield Slam in terms of threat generation. Seeing as Revenge has a low Rage cost, low cooldown, hits 2 targets, and deals very high damage, you will want to use this every time it is available."},{["spellID"]=47488,["name"]="Shield Slam",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Shield_05",["condition"]="Shield Slam — Whenever your Shield Block is not active you will prioritize using Shield Slam after Revenge as the damage Revenge deals is simply too high to pass on using."},{["spellID"]=46968,["name"]="Shockwave",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Shockwave",["condition"]="Shockwave — Shockwave scales very well by utilizing 75% of your Attack Power, which is more than any other ability. This means it becomes a powerful ability to use in single-target situations as you become more geared. At around 3,500 Attack Power you will want to prioritize using Shockwave over Devastate even against a single enemy."},{["spellID"]=20243,["name"]="Devastate",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_11",["condition"]="Devastate — Devastate is mostly a rotation filler. The talent Sword and Board gives Devastate a 30% chance to reset the cooldown of Shield Slam, reducing how many times you will use Devastate as a filler."},{["spellID"]=25286,["name"]="Heroic Strike",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Ambush",["condition"]="Heroic Strike — Lastly, you want to use Heroic Strike whenever you are above 60 Rage to prevent yourself from wasting Rage."}}}},["pvp"]={["overview"]={["ruRU"]={"Живучий боец с сильным контролем и поддержкой команды.","Много оглушений и полезных инструментов, особенно против ближнего боя.","Высокая зависимость от экипировки; это не обычный танковый рейдовый приоритет."},["enUS"]={"Protection Warrior is a medium damage melee class with very high utility and crowd control. It is also very tanky, especially when facing melee attackers. This build however is extremely gear dependent, being hard to utilize properly until you have nearly full Tier 9 and","Very tanky build, even with little to no Resilience; a nightmare to melee attackers. Extremely mobile, very hard to kite or root this build. Plenty of crowd control, allowing you to setup kills and peel for allies.","Extremely dependent on end-game PvE gear, especially from Tier 9 and Tier 10. Lack of Healing Reduction ability, unlike the Arms counterpart. Low Rage generation if not being attacked at all."}},["rotation"]={["ruRU"]="Комбинируйте давление с оглушениями и защитой напарника. Выбирайте момент для отражения и прерываний; не считайте PvE-угрозу или массовое танкование целью этого PvP-набора.",["enUS"]=""},["builds"]={{["key"]="pvp_0",["title"]="Talent Build For PvP Protection Warrior in Wrath of the Lich King (13/7/51)",["talentsString"]="0500320021-304-250031220223012520332113321",["targetLevel"]=80,["points"]=71,["allocations"]={{["talentID"]=130,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=16466,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Deflection",["nameRu"]="Deflection"},{["talentID"]=641,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12960,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Iron Will",["nameRu"]="Iron Will"},{["talentID"]=128,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12676,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Tactical Mastery",["nameRu"]="Tactical Mastery"},{["talentID"]=662,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=16494,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Impale",["nameRu"]="Impale"},{["talentID"]=121,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=12834,["tree"]=1,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Deep Wounds",["nameRu"]="Deep Wounds"},{["talentID"]=2250,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=61222,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=3,["name"]="Armored to the Teeth",["nameRu"]="Armored to the Teeth"},{["talentID"]=157,["rank"]=4,["spellID"]=12855,["tree"]=2,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Cruelty",["nameRu"]="Cruelty"},{["talentID"]=142,["rank"]=2,["spellID"]=12818,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=2,["name"]="Improved Bloodrage",["nameRu"]="Improved Bloodrage"},{["talentID"]=1601,["rank"]=5,["spellID"]=12727,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=10,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Shield Specialization",["nameRu"]="Shield Specialization"},{["talentID"]=138,["rank"]=3,["spellID"]=12751,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=15,["maxRank"]=5,["name"]="Anticipation",["nameRu"]="Anticipation"},{["talentID"]=153,["rank"]=1,["spellID"]=12975,["tree"]=3,["minLevel"]=20,["maxRank